stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> planned
  planned --> awaiting_approval: 需要精确批准
  planned --> dispatching: 范围与前提通过
  awaiting_approval --> dispatching: 批准有效且再次校验
  awaiting_approval --> rejected: 拒绝或过期
  dispatching --> accepted: 原生接收证据
  dispatching --> outcome_unknown: 接收结果未知
  accepted --> running: 精确关联的执行开始
  running --> settled: 执行结束（不等于验收通过）
  running --> stopped: 取消已结算
  running --> outcome_unknown: 副作用结果未知
  outcome_unknown --> accepted: 对账证实已接收
  outcome_unknown --> settled: 外部结果已核实
  outcome_unknown --> rejected: 证实未执行且取消
  settled --> [*]
  stopped --> [*]
  rejected --> [*]
